<p>
  Delivery Hero is a global food delivery platform that owns 17+ different food
  delivery brands across 70+ countries. At this scale, they process over 11
  million orders per day — 127 orders per second — making it the top food
  delivery company in the world.
</p>

<p>
  However, profit margins are pretty slim in the food delivery business and they
  must rely on other revenue sources, such as advertising, to boost
  profitability.
</p>

<p>
  AdTech is the main driver behind the company's profitability thanks to an
  average monthly revenue of €700 million. Within AdTech, I am the lead designer
  of the most valuable product, <strong>Sponsored Listings</strong>, which
  restaurants can use to promote their business in the apps.
</p>
